/E (The Reading Club was launched on September 11, 2024, driven by a strong belief that meaningful learning extends beyond traditional, rigid academic methods. The club was founded on the concept of learning through reading as an engaging and enjoyable approach, rather than a strictly structured or textbook-based one.)
